heartbeat: 2026-08-15T17:40:16Z
status: in-progress
done-so-far: diagnosed. The resident model is never released: the service registry probes the
  gateway with GET /v1/models, the activity middleware bumps last_active on ANY request without
  looking at the path, and com.rozum.doctor runs every 300s against a 1200s unload threshold — so
  the idle timer is reset four times before it can expire. Ruled out stale leases (dir empty since
  18:00) and a missing reload builder (can_reload() is true). Observed 93 min idle, 7.89 GiB still
  reserved, ROZUM_GATEWAY_UNLOAD_IDLE_SECS=1200 present in the running process.
next: file it, then make activity mean INFERENCE — a deny-list of liveness paths, because a missed
  probe means "did not unload" (today) while a missed inference path would mean "unloaded under a
  live client".
